{"steam_appid":1106840,"steam_name":"Hydroneer","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1106840/286759864/d548ba9ac2b3144972503a2b1b5db7d1806d2ce9/1777545087/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1777546947","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257329329/c1cb82091f577f69328d54300f1345970b40d1f5/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1777546947","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/ss_467a954b4ecf4fce9f4369ba280e3489791aa473.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777546952","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/03a7e65f7372237c428c536618414f1a938c268a/ss_03a7e65f7372237c428c536618414f1a938c268a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777546952","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/ss_36a45220d229b84c934af2ebdcbcd08659fce8fd.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777546952","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/df899636284369df5e0dfd0f3556ee0638b55393/ss_df899636284369df5e0dfd0f3556ee0638b55393.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777546952","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/ss_69888496c502a48f800b83b95ee722c789a27b06.1920x1080.jpg?t=1777546952"],"about_the_game":"Hydroneer is a mining sandbox game where you dig for gold and other resources to build massive mining machines and a base of operation. Use primitive tools, hydro-powered machines, and player-built structures to dig and evolve your operation in this tycoon-style progression system.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dig Deep!</h2>Using a state-of-the-art voxel based terrain system, you can create cave networks, quarry pits, or even mud mountains. Discover relics of the past in the depths of Hydroneer, with better rewards the deeper you dig. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/extras/5190899d98d3c586942c6848451aa36d.poster.avif?t=1777546952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/extras/5190899d98d3c586942c6848451aa36d.webm?t=1777546952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/extras/5190899d98d3c586942c6848451aa36d.mp4?t=1777546952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Forge, Build, and Create!</h2>Hydroneer features a dynamic modular system for building structures and hydro powered machinery. Create the base of operations from your own design to optimise your work. Create networks of hydro pipes, control pressure. Craft resources, weaponry, jewellery, grow vegetables, and cook soup for villagers.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/extras/5fb6d90ba0da073885677e629fdaaf4b.poster.avif?t=1777546952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/extras/5fb6d90ba0da073885677e629fdaaf4b.webm?t=1777546952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/extras/5fb6d90ba0da073885677e629fdaaf4b.mp4?t=1777546952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hydro Powered Vehicles</h2>Large hydro powered machines used for a variety of uses, from digging resources and finding ore veins, to transporting goods.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/extras/016b2515ee6fa24da4c463099519f3f2.poster.avif?t=1777546952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/extras/016b2515ee6fa24da4c463099519f3f2.webm?t=1777546952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/extras/016b2515ee6fa24da4c463099519f3f2.mp4?t=1777546952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the World of Hydroneer</h2>Various parcels of land await you in the world of Hydroneer, each with their own advantages. Deeper pits, attractive scenery, and closer stores. You decide where to build your base of operations.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/extras/77635d1a5bfe2e30d77348cdd71e95e8.poster.avif?t=1777546952\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/extras/77635d1a5bfe2e30d77348cdd71e95e8.webm?t=1777546952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1106840/extras/77635d1a5bfe2e30d77348cdd71e95e8.mp4?t=1777546952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-Core 64-bit Intel or AMD processor, 2.4 GHZ CPU<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 1 GB DirectX 11 dedicated video card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Casual","Indie","Simulation","Strategy"],"developers":["Foulball Hangover"],"publishers":["Foulball Hangover"],"release_date":"8 May, 2020"}